<template><div><div v-if="rows.length" class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>课程 / 任务编号</th><th>授课教师</th><th>授课班级</th><th>计划 / 排课学时</th><th>项目进度</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="row in rows" :key="row.id"><td><div class="course-cell"><span class="course-icon"><sf-icon name="book"/></span><div><strong>{{ row.course_name }}</strong><small>{{ row.course_code }} · {{ row.task_code }}</small></div></div></td><td><span class="person-cell"><span class="avatar tiny">{{ (row.teacher_names||'')[0] }}</span>{{ row.teacher_names }}</span></td><td>{{ row.class_composition }}</td><td><strong>{{ row.planned_lab_hours }}</strong><span class="muted"> / {{ row.scheduled_hours }} 学时</span></td><td><span class="badge" :class="Number(row.project_count)?'green':'amber'">{{ Number(row.project_count)?row.project_count+' 个项目':'待录入' }}</span></td><td><div class="row-actions"><button class="btn text" @click="$emit('detail',row)">课表</button><button class="btn text" @click="$router.push({path:'/teaching/projects',query:{taskId:row.id,termId:row.term_id}})">实验项目</button></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div v-else class="empty"><sf-icon name="search"/><strong>暂无符合条件的教学任务</strong><span>请选择有数据的学期，或通过导入中心导入真实课表。</span></div></div></template>
